5.5 LIMITATIONS
The plastic emission factors are subject to the following limitations:
• All processes are only representative of plastic resins and do not include final conversion to plastic products (e.g., recycled PET data does not include solid stating to convert the resin to a bottle-ready state) (FAL, 2011b, p. 2-16).


